<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67200" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετονομ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call by a new name</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ
				τῶν αἰγέων . . αἰγίδας . . μετωνόμασαν</span>
			<i>called</i> them <i>by a new name</i>—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγίδες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.189
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς φυλὰς μετωνόμασε</span>
			(sc. Cleisthenes) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.69
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.50
			</span></i> K.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>take</i> or <i>receive a new name</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ Λυδῶν μετονομασθῆναι ἐπὶ τοῦ
					βασιλέος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.94
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάττος μετωνομάσθη</span>”
				<i>took the name of</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.155
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφρόνησιν ἣ . . ὄνομα ἀφροσύνη
					μετωνόμασται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.122
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινῶς μετωνομασμένον</span>
			<i>new-fangled</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				180a
			</span></i>.</div>
